WEBVTT

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:26.750
<i>New days, it's the morning we begin. 
Let's give the world a kiss.</i>

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:35.240
<i>Blowing in the wind, with a little 
courage and love in our pockets.</i>

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:44.090
<i>I wish: If only I had wings,</i>

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:53.690
<i>I could fly over the sadness, 
the past, and my doubts.</i>

00:00:53.690 --> 00:01:02.450
<i>Oh, yeah! There's nothing to lose. 
(Take whatever the brand new day brings.)</i>

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:07.290
<i>Take my way! I wanna catch a miracle...</i>

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:11.030
<i>in the palm of my hand!</i>

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:19.720
<i>We're off on a journey through the endless 
earth, the skies, and the future.</i>

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:32.140
<i>I know these newborn wings, oh! 
Are gonna gonna gonna shine someday!</i>

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:35.440
The time has come!

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:40.620
All this time, we have obeyed 
the Scrapped Princess Elfitine,

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:43.450
endured patiently in this village, 
and gathered our strength!

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:46.080
But the world we long for is now at hand!

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:51.770
The future...

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:58.590
Our future shines so brightly 
that it is blinding!

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:01.720
Lady Elfitine!

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:12.280
Ow, ow, ow...

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:16.400
Are they starting a party 
up there or something?

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:21.410
"Serenade of the False Princess"

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:29.420
What's about to happen?

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:31.650
Nothing peaceful, that's for sure.

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:33.960
Let's look around for an escape 
route while they're busy here.

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:35.590
But they still have Mr. Berkens...

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:38.590
Who cares about that guy?

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:40.050
I'm gonna go look for him.

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.640
Hey! Pacifica!

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:45.930
All the villagers are here, so I 
think she'll be safe, don't you?

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:48.770
But the man is our enemy...

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:51.520
Could it be you're jealous of Pops?

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:52.650
Like hell!

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.610
Lady Elfitine.

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:00.100
It is time for your purification.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.010
I will go at once.

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:09.750
There aren't even any lookouts.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:15.340
This magical wall is fairly powerful.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:18.460
Well, I wasn't really expecting that 
we could just waltz out of here.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:21.550
Did that Reynard guy do this himself?

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:24.930
I don't think the capacity of his 
consciousness is great enough for that.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.490
Then are you saying that 
there are other wizards here?

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:29.140
That, or perhaps...

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:33.600
I can only hope that what 
I'm thinking is mistaken.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:38.700
It's a little inconvenient not to have a god 
that you can pray to at times like this, huh?

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:42.420
What's the matter?

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:44.410
There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:45.870
Yes, sir.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:49.580
Drink, then. This will 
bring about a proper world,

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:50.960
one ruled by the great Browning.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.390
That completes the power 
necessary for the core.

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:21.950
This will be enough to activate it.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:26.100
I checked the flows of magical force,

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:27.660
but it's strange...

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:30.820
I sensed a location with multiple 
signatures that were faint,

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:32.930
like candles going out.

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:36.960
It's probably beneath that 
meeting hall we were at earlier.

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:42.420
I wonder where Mr. Berkens is.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.070
What the heck is this big roadblock for?

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:01.980
Where's this steam coming from?

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:07.030
Who's there?

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:10.530
Huh? Is someone there?

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:18.080
Wait, you're one of the outsiders who...

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.460
My name's Pacifica.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:23.460
Hey, weren't you just up in the meeting hall?

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:27.930
Yes, although once I am done 
here, I will return to the hall.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:30.180
You'll catch a cold like that.

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:32.430
Why don't you join me until 
your clothes dry out?

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:33.930
Can I really?

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.890
People from the village 
join me from time to time.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:39.070
We don't tell Lord Reynard about it, though.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:41.550
To tell you the truth,

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:44.110
I am in the middle of a ceremony 
meant to purify my body,

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:47.110
so I am not to speak to anyone.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:49.820
But I suppose I've already spoken, haven't I?

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.790
Yahoo! I haven't been in a bath in ages!

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:57.330
I'm sorry, could you undo 
these clasps for me?

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:58.250
Yes, of course.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:01.590
I always get my sister Raquel to do it.

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:03.500
My brother Shannon does it sometimes, too.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:04.710
You three must be close.

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:07.690
No, all we ever do is fight.

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:08.470
Thanks!

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:12.180
Today, the world will be set to rights!

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:15.430
The dark age of Mauser's rule will end,

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:20.650
and a bright age will begin where we 
followers of Browning shall flourish!

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:23.730
What's this boring lecture all about?

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:25.620
Now, behold!

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:39.750
The great Browning has stirred!

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:44.800
The judgment of the <i>true </i>god is 
about to rain down upon Grendel,

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:47.170
the holy city of Mauser's believers!

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:51.280
I'm in paradise!

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:54.640
I guess it won't hurt anything 
if I relax here for a while...

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:57.930
Life in the outside world must be harsh.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:02.100
All the people who have come here had 
met with difficult times out there.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:06.900
But here in this village, 
everyone lives in peace.

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:09.240
You should stay here with us, Pacifica.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:12.610
Say, I heard that you can 
see the future, Elfitine!

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:14.320
Hm? Yes...

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:15.620
That's so amazing!

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:19.080
So, can you see a boyfriend 
or something in my future?

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:23.060
I'm sorry, I'm not able to 
see anything and everything.

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:25.290
Oh, you can't? That's kinda disappointing...

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:30.760
This is the first time I've ever 
spoken with anyone like this.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:35.010
It's because I'm this village's princess.

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:36.220
Oh, right.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:40.680
Pacifica, aren't you afraid of me?

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:42.560
No, why?

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:45.230
People from the outside say 
that the Scrapped Princess

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:48.570
is the poison that will destroy the world.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:52.360
And the way I can see things which 
haven't happened yet is far from normal.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:56.910
There's no shortage of abnormal people 
in my family, so I wouldn't really know.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:08:00.830
In the Church of Mauser, people 
with abilities like mine

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:03.500
are called the bastard children of demons.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:06.340
They say that having innate powers, 
ones that you haven't worked for,

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:07.880
is unnatural.

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.590
That's why everyone picked on me.

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.580
I made them nervous.

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:14.340
It's the same with me.

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:19.600
I'm hated by Mauser, too.

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:22.260
Everyone's afraid of me,

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:24.520
even though I don't even have 
any powers or anything...

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:31.440
What the heck is this?

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:33.340
What a weird room...

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:42.380
I knew it.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:47.750
Hey!

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:49.670
It's no use.

00:08:50.140 --> 00:08:53.190
I don't think that he even 
knows who he is right now.

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:55.540
So, each of these tubes has...

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.430
Someone is using these people's consciousness

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:00.890
to amplify the power of their spell.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:03.870
They've been put into a deep 
sleep by some medicine.

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:09.860
So, this is how that bastard Reynard cast 
the spell that's hiding this village, huh?

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:15.020
When the people in the hall started praying,

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:16.990
this pattern appeared.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.820
Oh, it's a spell circle.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:20.660
You've studied magic?

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:21.540
A little.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:24.410
I don't know how they're going to do it,

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:27.370
but they're trying to launch 
an attack on Grendel.

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:29.210
Is that even possible?

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:31.250
Yes, if they're using a strategic 
grade offensive spell.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:33.520
"Strategic grade"?

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:35.060
I don't like the sound of that.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:39.140
There are records of such spells 
being used twice in the past.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:42.810
In both cases, the fatalities numbered 
in the hundreds of thousands.

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:43.910
Are you serious?

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:47.220
But it couldn't possibly reach 
Grendel from here, could it?

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:51.270
With a long-range tactical 
grade offensive spell,

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:54.480
if enough powerful wizards chanted it,

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:58.280
they could send the spell from the edge 
of Leinwan all the way to the Giat Empire.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:03.380
But I don't see how this village 
could possibly use a spell of that...

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:06.250
What is it?

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:08.600
There might be more of these.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.190
Well, they aren't quite 
dry, but what the heck?

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:17.130
Say, Elfitine?

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:19.840
Everybody was gathered in the meeting hall,

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:21.450
so is something about to happen?

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.030
What's the matter?

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:28.610
I'm scared.

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:32.440
I couldn't speak of this to anyone,

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:35.400
but I had a vision of this village's future.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:37.680
Everything was dark.

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:40.500
It was as if there wasn't 
a single soul alive.

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:45.220
How could that be the result of 
our setting the world to rights?

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:47.500
What're you going to do?

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:53.520
Lord Reynard says that he is going to use a 
spell to destroy the holy city of Grendel.

00:10:54.410 --> 00:10:56.090
What're you saying?

00:10:56.090 --> 00:11:00.130
But Lord Reynard says that 
it is a righteous act.

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:01.970
That doesn't sound right to me.

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:08.930
But I never would have survived 
if it weren't for Lord Reynard.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:13.700
Lord Reynard is not like the others.

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:19.740
When I was wishing that 
I had never been born,

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:23.870
it was Lord Reynard who gave me hope.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:27.770
That is why I have always believed.

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:29.700
Because it was Lord Reynard who said it.

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:33.380
I've always believed...

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:36.340
All this time, I've believed him...

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:41.300
You know, I...

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:45.220
I was abandoned right after I was born.

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:50.270
But Shannon and Raquel's parents 
took me in and raised me.

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:55.730
I'm the person I am now because Shannon 
and Raquel were in that house,

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:57.860
but if someone else had found me,

00:11:57.860 --> 00:12:02.240
I think I would've had no choice but 
to believe in and rely on that person.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:06.490
I believe in Shannon and Raquel, too.

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.040
Because in this whole world,

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:12.910
my brother and sister are the 
only ones who believe in me.

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:17.610
That's why if it turns out 
that I shouldn't be alive,

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:19.890
I want the two of them to kill me.

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:25.050
Elfitine, are you really 
the Scrapped Princess?

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:30.600
I... I'm...

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:32.190
Well...

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:35.060
Lord Reynard says that I am, so I must be.

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:42.280
I'm sorry. I'm going to go tell them.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:56.760
Hey!

00:12:57.440 --> 00:13:00.380
You dumb kitten! Where have 
you been at a time like this?

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:03.360
Huh? Did you just take a bath?

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:04.650
Got it in one.

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:06.340
Hey, little lady.

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:08.470
Are you okay, Pops?

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:09.750
Yeah, thanks to you folks.

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:12.240
Listen, I just heard something terrible!

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:14.060
Elfitine and her people are going to...

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:16.130
Destroy the holy city, right?

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:17.310
How did you know that?!

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:19.570
There's no time to explain.

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:20.860
We're getting out of here.

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.070
You aren't going to try to stop the spell?

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:24.690
It's got nothing to do with us.

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:26.200
Shannon?!

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.700
Escaping comes first.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:28.950
Shannon!

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.660
Are you serious?

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:35.460
All right, then. I'll go do it myself.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:37.050
You're a real hard worker, aren't you?

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:39.500
You must really want to move up the ranks.

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:40.630
It isn't about that.

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:48.130
The truth is, it doesn't have 
to be Mauser <i>or </i>Browning.

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:53.010
But I think it's only natural that you've 
gotta believe in something to get by in life.

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:56.980
Otherwise, life's too hard to get through.

00:13:57.680 --> 00:14:00.520
But don't you think it's 
crazy to crush somebody

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:03.650
just because they believe in 
something different than you?

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:06.600
That's exactly what <i>you </i>people have done.

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:08.610
That's why I want to stop them.

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:13.080
I want to keep them from making the 
same mistake the Church of Mauser did.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.120
Man, what a pain in the ass...

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.080
Let's get one thing straight.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:23.040
I don't think what you're saying is right.

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:26.050
Shall we go, then?

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:30.760
The flows of magical force are 
all converging below this area.

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:36.150
Elfitine. Let's go.

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:39.200
We're leaving this village.

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:56.540
What's this?

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.980
There are people in all of those?

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:02.850
The power is being collected here.

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:11.250
This... isn't right.

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:15.390
The spell won't reach 
Grendel... Not with this.

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:20.800
This spell might detonate right here.

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:24.360
If we don't stop the people in the meeting 
hall from praying, and fast, it'll...

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:26.720
I doubt we could make them stop.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:29.150
We should go find that Reynard guy.

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:31.750
He's probably run away already.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:34.030
Give me a hand here.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.040
Push down on each of these 
figures one at a time.

00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:39.540
I'll do it!

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:50.010
These places always seem 
to have stuff like this.

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:54.180
Why are we leaving the village, Lord Reynard?

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:57.890
I'm carrying out the plan that I 
had in mind all along, that's all.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.980
They're going to die, just as I planned.

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:01.780
Who do you mean?

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:05.010
I mean those fools in the village.

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:11.950
The deaths of those villagers who worship 
Browning is what will fix this world.

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:15.070
You don't need to think about it.

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:18.490
You only need to come 
with me to the holy city.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:23.000
You've sure got a lot of 
costume changes, don't you?

00:16:23.300 --> 00:16:25.260
The Inquisitor, eh?

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:26.250
Excellent timing.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:29.570
You'll come with us to the holy 
city and make your report.

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:33.130
Report that I've sent a whole village 
of heretics straight to hell.

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:35.870
I neglected to mention this,

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:39.100
but I'm an Inquisitor, just like you.

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:43.150
What good will destroying this village do?

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:44.560
A foolish question.

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:48.770
Once they learn that I've destroyed 
a group of Browning worshippers,

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:51.610
my value in the holy city will skyrocket.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.860
I'm going to become the head of the church!

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:56.110
What's this guy talking about?

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:59.330
Central command won't put any 
stock in this scam of yours.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:02.340
They won't, huh? How unfortunate.

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:06.250
Stand back!

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:11.460
I've nothing to say to people who are 
unable to understand my righteous acts.

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:15.180
Hey! What do you think you're doing?

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:17.310
I believe in you.

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:21.140
I believe in you.

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:27.030
I have faith in you.

00:17:27.030 --> 00:17:28.770
Let's go back to the village.

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:31.270
Y-You should come with me!

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:35.280
I can't do that. I will stay here.

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:39.740
The people of the village have 
believed in me and followed me.

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:44.250
And so I will go back and join the villagers.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:49.040
Y-You don't need to think 
about anything but what I...

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.500
Don't look! Don't look!

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:58.340
Don't look at me!

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:05.270
Elfitine!

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.230
Damn it!

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:12.460
That guy is nuts...

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:17.300
Are there more idiots like 
him in the Church of Mauser?

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:19.160
Don't ask me.

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:30.770
Everyone! Please stop praying!

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:35.210
Your prayers will lead 
to your own destruction!

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:37.700
Lady Elfitine...

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:39.500
Reynard has fled.

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:44.380
And there is something that I must tell you.

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:46.460
I am...

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:50.190
I am not the Scrapped Princess!

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:52.150
I have been deceiving you all this time.

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:55.450
I am truly sorry.

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.370
Lady Elfitine...

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:12.360
Please lift your head.

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:31.640
Lady... Elfitine?

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:41.110
If you go straight down this tunnel,

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:43.070
it comes out in the Giat Empire.

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:44.200
Thank you.

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:45.410
Take care.

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:46.530
You, too, Elfitine.

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:49.710
Elfitine?

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:55.340
I don't know if an inexperienced girl 
like me can lead this village...

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:58.590
But you don't see that dark 
future anymore, right?

00:19:59.810 --> 00:20:02.120
Besides, you're pretty regal, Elfitine,

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:03.530
so I think it'll work out, don't you?

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:07.550
What about you, Berkens?

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:12.140
I'll see how things turn out here 
before going back to Grendel.

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:13.980
I don't feel much like reporting in.

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:15.880
Oh, one more thing...

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:21.140
The real Scrapped Princess must 
have it pretty rough, too.

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:25.570
There are Inquisitors 
in the Giat Empire, too.

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:27.160
Make sure you keep her safe, you hear?

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:31.050
I was expecting somebody who was 
more like a witch or something,

00:20:31.050 --> 00:20:32.540
but she's a sweet kid.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:36.290
Eat this on the way.

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:36.290
Thanks.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:37.590
Thanks so much!

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:40.130
Goodbye!

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:42.960
Goodbye, everybody!

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:51.360
We're close enough to see it now.

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:58.580
There it is...

00:20:58.580 --> 00:21:01.850
the castle where Queen Elmyr, mother 
of the Scrapped Princess, lives.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:21.730
<i>A blessing of rain falls quietly. (Falls.)</i>

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:27.050
<i>Droplets of my love, 
which fall for someone...</i>

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:34.230
<i>who is still waiting in a land far away.</i>

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:40.020
<i>The morning wind blows, caressing 
my cheek. (What was that...)</i>

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:45.150
<i>Did you feel something, feel something 
just now? (...on my cheek?)</i>

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:48.320
<i>It goes up to the one and only sky... 
(More certain than anything.)</i>

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:53.370
<i>a sky which has a fixed, certain meaning.</i>

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:59.920
<i>I come to a stop in the shadow 
of clouds that chase after me.</i>

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:03.380
<i>This journey of the heart 
that I wish to gaze upon...</i>

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:06.590
<i>goes on forever and goes on forever.</i>

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:13.220
<i>One day I will chance upon the 
voice I've not heard in so long.</i>

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:15.180
<i>Alainn la-li-la.</i>

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>At last the ship sets sail, sets sail. 
(The ship glides on forever...)</i>

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:25.190
<i>Yes, believe in this wide world... 
(...to the edge of seas unknown.)</i>

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:28.530
<i>and go off into the distance.</i>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:32.630
<i>And onwards into the future.</i>

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:46.460
"Next Time"

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:36.660
At a beach beyond the underground tunnel,

00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:40.000
Pacifica meets a foreign princess 
who commands a group of soldiers.

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:42.170
Apparently, she's known 
as the Beast Princess.

00:22:42.170 --> 00:22:44.090
What sort of princess is a 
Beast Princess, I wonder?

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:46.460
Does she attack people with tooth and claw?

00:22:46.460 --> 00:22:48.220
Next time on <i>Scrapped Princess</i>,

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:49.550
"Rhapsody of the Beast Princess."

00:22:49.550 --> 00:22:50.470
Please tune in!
